SUMMARY:Wicker
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Times: 1:05pm\, 4:40pm\, 7:15pm\, 9:45pm\nAn audacious comedic 
 fable about sex\, marriage\, and the absurdities of social convention\, WI
 CKER tells the wholly original love story of an ostracized fisherwoman (Ol
 ivia Colman) who commissions a husband to be made by the local basketmaker
  (Peter Dinklage). When her wicker husband (Alexander Skarsgård) proves m
 ore spectacular than she ever imagined\, his soulful spirit and unique pro
 wess awaken something inside her\, setting off a wave of jealousy\, fascin
 ation\, and upheaval that threatens the very fabric of village life.\nhttp
 s://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/183805e9-e816-5eed-b32a-
 29e91225f9e2\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
