 night at the movies-grappling with busted dreams\, bad popcorn\, and hard 
 goodbyes. Stay after the screening for a Q&A with director Mas Bouzidi and
  actor Jonathan Lorenzo Price!\nhttps://www.somervilletheatre.com/producti
 on/concessions/\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.somervilletheatre.com/production/concessions/
END:VEVENT
