SUMMARY:Wicker
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:An audacious comedic fable about sex\, marriage\, and the absur
 dities of social convention\, WICKER tells the wholly original love story 
 of an ostracized fisherwoman (Olivia Colman) who commissions a husband to 
 be made by the local basketmaker (Peter Dinklage). When her wicker husband
  (Alexander Skarsgård) proves more spectacular than she ever imagined\, h
 is soulful spirit and unique prowess awaken something inside her\, setting
  off a wave of jealousy\, fascination\, and upheaval that threatens the ve
 ry fabric of village life.\nhttps://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ti
 cketing/a44a0722-358d-545c-8bf0-c23590459cec\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https:/
